<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 21.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Hampshire Apr 99.00 May 100.00</p>
<p>Avon range Jun 101.00</p>
<p>East Devon Apr 98.50</p>
<p>Essex Apr 99.00</p>
<p>Suffolk/Essex Apr 100.00 May 100.00</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Jun 102.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Southampton Apr 100.25</p>
<p>No milling wheat traded was reported.</p>
</text>
